-- Alice ends it, by name in any case: both are told
@1000 conn#2 sends RemoveFriend BOB
   -> send conn#2 FriendChanged Bob status=0
   -> store #10: end the friendship of #1 and #2
   -> send conn#4 FriendChanged Alice status=0
   -> event: character 1 is no longer friends with character 2
@1000 store answers #10: friendship written: Ok(())
-- a name not in her list is ignored
@1000 conn#2 sends RemoveFriend Bob
   -> event: conn#2: ignored RemoveFriend
-- friends again; Bob leaves and Alice ends it while he is away
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#4 FriendAsked Alice
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@1000 conn#4 sends AnswerFriend Alice accept=true
   -> store #11: make #2 and #1 friends
   -> send conn#4 FriendChanged Alice status=2
   -> send conn#2 FriendChanged Bob status=2
   -> event: characters 2 and 1 became friends
@1000 store answers #11: friendship written: Ok(())
@1000 conn#4 closed: the client left
   -> store #12: save #2 at (963400, 278200) played 0s
   -> send conn#2 FriendChanged Bob status=1
   -> send conn#2 EntityRemove vid=2
   -> event: conn#4: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #12: saved: Ok(())
@1000 conn#2 sends RemoveFriend Bob
   -> send conn#2 FriendChanged Bob status=0
   -> store #13: end the friendship of #1 and #2
   -> event: character 1 is no longer friends with character 2
@1000 store answers #13: friendship written: Ok(())
-- Bob comes back with no friends
